              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">One crewman armed with bow, javelins, shield and light armour riding in a two-horse light chariot with driver. Egyptian charioteers do not suffer -1 to hit for shooting on the move and are able to shoot as they charge. (Armies of Antiquity p.5)</characteristic>
