              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapons, javelins and shield. Light Infantry. Your army may include up to one unit of chariot runners for each unit of chariots. If the runners join the chariot unit when it is engaged in hand-to-hand combat, any runners touching a chariot or enemy model may fight as well. (Armies of Antiquity p.5)</characteristic>
