            <profile id="79ba-a035-cc2d-b7b1" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="aab0-aa1e-0319-4ffe" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon and bow. May have light armour (+3 pts). May have javelins and shield instead of a bow (+1 pt). A unit of Marines may be made up entirely of javelin men or archers or include both, in which case the unit counts as being armed with the weapons carried by the majority of the unit at the start of the battle. (Armies of Antiquity p.5)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="7b9c-897a-419c-fe7c" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
